---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Laravel ECS Deployment - Mark Lester Perez">
  <main class="project-page">
    <h1>Laravel ECS Deployment</h1>
    
    <section class="overview">
      <h2>Project Overview</h2>
      <p>
        This project demonstrates how to deploy Laravel applications to AWS ECS using GitLab CI/CD,
        containerization with Docker, and infrastructure as code using Terraform.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="technologies">
      <h2>Technologies Used</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>AWS ECS (Elastic Container Service)</li>
        <li>Laravel Framework</li>
        <li>Docker & Docker Compose</li>
        <li>Terraform</li>
        <li>GitLab CI/CD</li>
        <li>AWS RDS (PostgreSQL)</li>
        <li>AWS ElastiCache Redis</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="implementation">
      <h2>Implementation Details</h2>
      <h3>Infrastructure Setup</h3>
      <p>
        The infrastructure is managed using Terraform, which provisions:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>ECS Cluster with Fargate launch type</li>
        <li>Application Load Balancer</li>
        <li>RDS PostgreSQL instance</li>
        <li>ElastiCache Redis cluster</li>
        <li>VPC with public and private subnets</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>CI/CD Pipeline</h3>
      <p>
        The GitLab CI/CD pipeline automates:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Building and testing Laravel application</li>
        <li>Creating Docker images</li>
        <li>Pushing images to ECR</li>
        <li>Deploying to ECS</li>
        <li>Running database migrations</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="architecture">
      <h2>Architecture Overview</h2>
      <p>
        The application follows a microservices architecture pattern:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Web service running Laravel</li>
        <li>Queue worker for background jobs</li>
        <li>Scheduled tasks container</li>
        <li>Separate RDS instance for database</li>
        <li>Redis for caching and queue management</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .project-page {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 6rem 2rem;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 3rem;
    color: var(--heading);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  section {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  h2 {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  h3 {
    color: var(--heading);
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0 1rem;
  }

  p {
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  ul {
    list-style-type: none;
    padding: 0;
  }

  li {
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  li::before {
    content: "•";
    color: var(--accent);
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
  }
</style>